  "origin": "DFM8 repaired OpenHermes dataset: a Danish-translated/repaired version of the OpenHermes instruction-tuning corpus (originally GPT-4-generated synthetic data from open sources, assembled by teknium). The dataset was translated to Danish and audited/repaired by schneiderkamplab. 967,334 rows. Form: translated + audited. Contributed 922M sampled tokens per epoch to the DFM Mimir v1 corpus (1.31%). The underlying OpenHermes data carries no single explicit license; the schneiderkamplab derivative is published under Apache 2.0.",
